% SYNTAX: "%" is not a comment character inside a BibTeX entry, only between
% entries - so every note sits above its entry. Never write an at-sign in a
% comment here; BibTeX reads it as the start of an entry.
%
% ======================= CORRECTIONS TO lit/01 =========================
