%    ": Skill, Not Lineage, Governs Trusted-Monitor Ensembles".
% 3. 2607.09786 -> author is Bryce Little. lit/01 recorded NO author for the
%    paper we credit with owning the scratchpad-regex instrument.
% 4. 2602.10153 -> authors are Sreevatsa, Prasanna and Rushing. lit/01 had none.
% 5. 2602.02079 (AICD) -> lit/01's "Paul" and "Wang" are not surnames. They are
%    Indraneil Paul and Yuxia Wang. Citing "Paul et al." would have been wrong.
% 6. 2607.06596 (Pinto) -> has a venue lit/01 did not record: accepted at the
